<% item = @flag.flaggable %>
Hi <%= @admin.name %>,

<% if @flag.flaggable_type == "Book" -%>
<%= @flag.reporter.name %> reported the book "<%= item.title %>" added by <%= item.user.name %>.
<% else -%>
<%= @flag.reporter.name %> reported a comment by <%= item.user.name %> on "<%= item.book.title %>":

  <%= truncate(item.body, length: 300) %>
<% end -%>

Reason: <%= @flag.reason_label %><% if @flag.note %> - "<%= @flag.note %>"<% end %>

Review reported content: <%= admin_flags_url %>

You're getting this because you're an admin of Bookshelf.
